OL,3,GNEWSASeagull impersonator says birds
OL,4,Aget a 'bad press'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe winner of a seagull impersonation
OL,7,Fcontest says she thinks the birds get
OL,8,F"a bad press" and sound "fantastic."
OL,10,FTrish Clemit, from Hebden Bridge in
OL,11,Fwest Yorkshire, has been crowned
OL,12,Foverall winner of the 2026 Seagull
OL,13,FFestival Championships in
OL,14,FWeston-super-Mare in north Somerset,
OL,15,Fhaving discovered her hidden talent at
OL,16,FButlins aged eight.
OL,18,F"All my life I've been waiting for a
OL,19,Fcompetition then I found out about this
OL,20,Fone through a friend and I thought
OL,21,Fright, I'm going down all the way from
OL,22,FHebden," she said.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
